      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 544,
        "height": 816,
        "content": "## How it works\n\nThis workflow automatically collects invoice emails from Gmail, downloads attached PDF invoices, and extracts important details using AI such as vendor name, invoice number, amount, and due date. The extracted data is stored in Google Sheets for tracking. The workflow also checks for duplicate invoices to avoid repeated entries. Every day, it monitors invoice due dates, calculates remaining days, sends reminder emails and Slack notifications, and automatically updates overdue invoice status.\n\n\n## Setup steps\n\n1. Connect Gmail account in n8n  \n2. Connect OpenAI API for invoice data extraction  \n3. Connect Google Sheets for invoice tracking  \n4. Configure Slack credentials for notifications  \n5. Create invoice tracker sheet with required columns  \n6. Activate workflow to start automatic invoice monitoring and reminders"
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    }
